#. fr: Parler à Hoary Boulder
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/004/GaiUse611_00423:TEXT_GAIUSE611_00423_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Hoary Boulder."
msgstr "Поговорить с Хоари Боулдером."

